safix::touch_policy_never

  × touch-policy never is refused. The touch is the property a card is for,
  │ and an identity generated without it is a smartcard emulating a file.
  │ 
  │ The policies safix generates with are pin-policy once and touch-policy
  │ cached, which is what this fleet's enrolled cards carry: one PIN entry per
  │ session, and one touch cached for fifteen seconds.
